When you explicitly use the ` orderBy() ` clause to add the predicates, Cloud
Firestore uses the ` (salary ASC, experience ASC) ` index to run the query.
Thus, since the selectivity of the first range filter is higher in this query
compared to the earlier query, the query runs faster and is more cost-
