able multiple times before the next render, instead of passing the _next
state value_ like ` setNumber(number + 1) ` , you can pass a _function_ that
calculates the next state based on the previous one in the queue, like `
setNumber(n => n + 1) ` . It is a way to tell React to “do something with the
